ured, so Runar Alex Runarsson should start, Mattsson and Nasnas are out, Cornelius and Asger Sorensen stayed home, and Maseko (counted as out) travelled. Inter are without Domi Berlanga and defender Alex Sanchez through suspension, and Danish reports say coach Felip Ortiz may leave after this game. The match is at about 1,240 m in Encamp in near-freezing weather after a flight to Lleida and a three-hour bus ride. Maltese referee Matthew De Gabriele has no usable record in the numbers; copenhagen are coached by Bo Svensson; no lineups are out yet.","goals":{"lean":"higher","adjust_pct":4,"call":"Around 3.0 goals","text":"The numbers say 2.9 goals, already cut for Maseko's absence (-6% on Copenhagen's goals), though he is in the travelling squad. I lean slightly higher, to about 3.0: backup Runarsson starts behind a defence that just shipped five, and Inter lose defender Alex Sanchez to a ban on top of Berlanga, neither of which the numbers know. Expected rotation before Midtjylland, Cornelius staying home and the cold at altitude keep the size small."},"corners":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 9 corners","text":"The numbers say 8.9 corners, split almost evenly. Copenhagen should have most of the ball against one of the weakest sides ever in this stage, but their recent corner count is already trimmed by momentum and a rotated side may be less sharp, so the two cancel out and I stay at 8.9."},"cards":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 4.5 cards","text":"The numbers say 4.5 cards, already counting both sides' recent card counts. Inter have two players banned for yellow-card build-up, which shows how often they end up chasing games, but that is in their record, and referee De Gabriele has no record here that points either way, so I stay at 4.5."},"shots":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 23 shots","text":"The numbers say 23.4 shots, already cut for Inter's low shot count lately (-8%). Copenhagen have kept only about half their side from game to game recently and play Midtjylland on Sunday, and altitude and cold may slow the pace, but there is no lineup news to say how much, so I stay at 23.4."},"shots_on_target":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 9 on target","text":"The numbers say 9.1 shots on target, with Inter's few efforts on target (-6%) and Copenhagen's chances against a leaky defence (+3%) already counted. A backup goalkeeper changes how many go in more than how many are on target, so I stay at 9.1."},"sources":["https://fck.dk/nyhed/truppen-mod-inter-descaldes","https://www.tipsbladet.dk/nyhed/conference-league/fck-moeder-de-daarligste-nogensinde-i-et-gruppespil","https://www.tipsbladet.dk/nyhed/conference-league/fck-kampen-bliver-hans-sidste","https://fck.dk/nyhed/andorra-venter-vores-naesthojeste-europaeiske-udekamp","https://starting11.com/fixtures/inter-club-descaldes-vs-fc-copenhagen","https://www.fr12.nl/matchcenter/match/Europa Conference League/inter-club-descaldes-fc-kobenhavn-20262027-europa-conference-league-2026-11-26-210000/19874045"],"written_at":"2026-11-26T16:45:00Z"},"league":"conference-league","take":{"applied":true,"written_at":"2026-11-26T16:45:00Z","goals":{"home":1.276,"away":1.935,"total":3.211,"adjust_pct":4.0,"sized":true,"lean":"higher","home_win":0.236,"draw":0.251,"away_win":0.513,"over":{"1.5":0.845,"2.5":0.622,"3.5":0.4},"over_show":{"1.5":0.845,"2.5":0.622,"3.5":0.4,"4.5":0.221,"5.5":0.107},"btts":0.632,"likely_scores":[{"score":"1-1","p":0.114},{"score":"1-2","p":0.096},{"score":"0-2","p":0.075},{"score":"2-1","p":0.063},{"score":"0-1","p":0.063}],"clean_sheet_home":0.144,"clean_sheet_away":0.279,"range":[1,6],"take_line":{"over":{"line":"1.5","p":0.845,"shown":true},"under":{"line":"5.5","p":0.893,"shown":true}}},"corners":{"home":4.445,"away":4.462,"total":8.907,"adjust_pct":0.0,"sized":true,"lean":"same","over":{"8.5":0.522,"9.5":0.401,"10.5":0.293,"11.5":0.203},"over_show":{"6.5":0.763,"7.5":0.647,"8.5":0.522,"9.5":0.401,"10.5":0.293},"range"